          With a foundation in Marine Corps leadership and extensive federal security
          experience—including roles within the U.S. Department of State, Diplomatic
          Security Service, ICE, and international security operations—we bring a
          disciplined, mission‑focused approach to every engagement.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our consulting philosophy emphasizes readiness, accountability, and
          operational clarity. We help organizations build secure environments,
          strengthen internal processes, and elevate leadership performance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

